          "type": "Compose",
          "inputs": "Hi @{first(body('List_rows')?['value'])?['cmdspp_p_fst_nam']} ,\n\nTo continue processing your enrollment application, please provide the following information:\n\n• @{triggerOutputs()?['body/cmdspp_p_req_desc']}\n\nThank you for your prompt response.\n\nBest regards,\nCMDS Next Gen Provider Portal Support Team"
